From 7bd9fd704dd3cea530174c127bf9a93e55d93b5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 30 May 2024 19:36:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-165981] emb cmn: deleted common function and files

Deleted the common functions and files between legacy preboot
and preboot rtos and moved it to emb common mods folder.

Included emb common mods files for baremetal compilation.

Change-Id: I1c62aec467c35862752ee4a044357e2b73626640
Signed-off-by: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
